      "metric": "revenue",
      "statement": "IT hardware business is expected to reach INR 15,000 to 20,000 crores in the next couple of years.",
      "quote": "We feel that in next couple of years, this is going to be almost INR 15,000 crore to INR 20,000 crore business for us.",
